${PKGSTEM} requires no special privileges and writes no files
and may thus be run as unprivileged user, e.g. via crontab(5):

	# useradd -g =uid -s /sbin/nologin -d /nonexistent ${USER}

certbot with the following ${SYSCONFDIR}/letsencrypt/cli.ini
snippet can be used to facilitate ACME DNS-01 challenge responses:

	authenticator = manual
	preferred-challenges = dns-01
	manual-auth-hook = ${TRUEPREFIX}/${HOOKS_PATH}/auth -k .../authorized_key.json
